{
    "title": "Brazilian Phonk: beat maker",
    "description": "Funk Brasil - Be the funk DJ in your neighborhood and create music with the best music production studio!\r\n\r\nGet ready to get into the rhythm of funk like never before with Funk Brasil. The music production app dedicated to funk lovers, DJs and MCs. Create beats, create beats, mix and share your beats.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb5 Create Amazing Funk Beats: Explore high-quality beat maker tools.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa4 Perfect for MCs and DJs: Our funk sequencer and beat library are ideal for MCs and DJs who want to create the next funk dance hit or relive the classic funk songs of the old and cheesy funk.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa7 Professional Mixing: Perfect your mixes with professional mixing tools and sound effects.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcc0 Export and Share: Show your creations to the world, directly from the app, and make your sound echo at funk dances.\r\n\r\nUnlock the full potential of your talent and become a master of beat production with Funk Brasil.\r\n\r\nMaster the Rhythm of Baile Funk! Download Now.\r\n\r\nFunk Brasil provides all the tools you need to master the art of creating beats on your smartphone or tablet. Now you can create amazing music with ease, wherever you are! Perfect for those who have a passion for making music!\r\n\r\nNo need for expensive equipment such as physical samplers, electronic drums or drum pads!\r\nFunk Brasil offers a variety of kits with high-quality sounds, allowing you to create any music you want! In addition, you can create your own kit, allowing you to choose your own sounds and record your own samplers.\r\n\r\nMake beats like a professional music producer and become a beat maker!\r\n\r\nCreate your own beat kit and samplers and share it, as well as videos of your performances, with your friends and on social media!\r\n\r\nYou don't need a physical sampler, electronic drums or drum pads!\r\nFunk Brasil is an excellent choice for making beats quietly, making noise or needing a lot of space. Enjoy the freedom to produce music wherever you want!\r\n\r\nFunk Brasil allows children and adults to make music while having fun and improving their cognitive skills. This app will stimulate your musical talents!\r\n\r\nWith Funk Brasil, you can make songs like:\r\n- Funk das Antigas\r\n- Funk Ostenta\u00e7\u00e3o\r\n- Funk Carioca\r\n- Funk Paulista\r\n- Brega Funk\r\n- Love Funk\r\n- Fank Antigo\r\n- Funk You\r\n- Funk Town\r\n- Rap\r\n- Trap\r\n- Electronic\r\n- Reggaeton\r\n- Hip Hop\r\n- R&B\r\n- Sertanejo\r\n- Pop.\r\n- and much more!\r\n\r\nSo, what are you waiting for to become a music producer and be a hit at the funk party? Start making music with Funk Brasil today! Download now and unleash your creativity!\r\n\r\nExplore Funk Brasil's features:\r\n- Over 200 drum kits to create music\r\n- In-app tutorial\r\n- YouTube videos showing how to play\r\n- Easy to play, as it has pads with loops of beats and grooves\r\n- Customize your kits: upload your sounds and record your spots, beats and samples\r\n- Wide variety of tools to create beats\r\n- New drum kits introduced weekly\r\n- 30 drum pads\r\n- Studio quality audio\r\n- Recording mode\r\n- Share your recordings and custom kits on social media\r\n- Export your recordings to MP3 format\r\n- Compatible with all screen resolutions - Cell phones and Tablets (HD images)\r\n- Free app\r\n- MIDI support\r\n- Multitouch capability\r\n\r\nTry and enjoy the best DJ app on Google Play! Designed for DJs, MCs, music producers, professional musicians, enthusiasts and beginners!\r\n\r\nFrom the creator of Real Drum!\r\n\r\nFollow us on TikTok, Instagram, Facebook and YouTube for tips on how to use the app: @kolbapps\r\n\r\nKolb Apps: Touch & Play!\r\n\r\nKeywords: funk, brazil, dj, mpc, launchpad, points, beats, remix, kits, mixagem, mc, jogo, drums, musica, pads, criar, jogar, fank, beat maker",
    "descriptionHTML": "Funk Brasil - Be the funk DJ in your neighborhood and create music with the best music production studio!<br><br>Get ready to get into the rhythm of funk like never before with Funk Brasil. The music production app dedicated to funk lovers, DJs and MCs. Create beats, create beats, mix and share your beats.<br><br>\ud83c\udfb5 Create Amazing Funk Beats: Explore high-quality beat maker tools.<br><br>\ud83c\udfa4 Perfect for MCs and DJs: Our funk sequencer and beat library are ideal for MCs and DJs who want to create the next funk dance hit or relive the classic funk songs of the old and cheesy funk.<br><br>\ud83c\udfa7 Professional Mixing: Perfect your mixes with professional mixing tools and sound effects.<br><br>\ud83d\udcc0 Export and Share: Show your creations to the world, directly from the app, and make your sound echo at funk dances.<br><br>Unlock the full potential of your talent and become a master of beat production with Funk Brasil.<br><br>Master the Rhythm of Baile Funk! Download Now.<br><br>Funk Brasil provides all the tools you need to master the art of creating beats on your smartphone or tablet. Now you can create amazing music with ease, wherever you are! Perfect for those who have a passion for making music!<br><br>No need for expensive equipment such as physical samplers, electronic drums or drum pads!<br>Funk Brasil offers a variety of kits with high-quality sounds, allowing you to create any music you want! In addition, you can create your own kit, allowing you to choose your own sounds and record your own samplers.<br><br>Make beats like a professional music producer and become a beat maker!<br><br>Create your own beat kit and samplers and share it, as well as videos of your performances, with your friends and on social media!<br><br>You don&#39;t need a physical sampler, electronic drums or drum pads!<br>Funk Brasil is an excellent choice for making beats quietly, making noise or needing a lot of space. Enjoy the freedom to produce music wherever you want!<br><br>Funk Brasil allows children and adults to make music while having fun and improving their cognitive skills. This app will stimulate your musical talents!<br><br>With Funk Brasil, you can make songs like:<br>- Funk das Antigas<br>- Funk Ostenta\u00e7\u00e3o<br>- Funk Carioca<br>- Funk Paulista<br>- Brega Funk<br>- Love Funk<br>- Fank Antigo<br>- Funk You<br>- Funk Town<br>- Rap<br>- Trap<br>- Electronic<br>- Reggaeton<br>- Hip Hop<br>- R&amp;B<br>- Sertanejo<br>- Pop.<br>- and much more!<br><br>So, what are you waiting for to become a music producer and be a hit at the funk party? Start making music with Funk Brasil today! Download now and unleash your creativity!<br><br>Explore Funk Brasil&#39;s features:<br>- Over 200 drum kits to create music<br>- In-app tutorial<br>- YouTube videos showing how to play<br>- Easy to play, as it has pads with loops of beats and grooves<br>- Customize your kits: upload your sounds and record your spots, beats and samples<br>- Wide variety of tools to create beats<br>- New drum kits introduced weekly<br>- 30 drum pads<br>- Studio quality audio<br>- Recording mode<br>- Share your recordings and custom kits on social media<br>- Export your recordings to MP3 format<br>- Compatible with all screen resolutions - Cell phones and Tablets (HD images)<br>- Free app<br>- MIDI support<br>- Multitouch capability<br><br>Try and enjoy the best DJ app on Google Play! Designed for DJs, MCs, music producers, professional musicians, enthusiasts and beginners!<br><br>From the creator of Real Drum!<br><br>Follow us on TikTok, Instagram, Facebook and YouTube for tips on how to use the app: @kolbapps<br><br>Kolb Apps: Touch &amp; Play!<br><br>Keywords: funk, brazil, dj, mpc, launchpad, points, beats, remix, kits, mixagem, mc, jogo, drums, musica, pads, criar, jogar, fank, beat maker",
